---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About RunFps" description="RunFps helps gamers estimate FPS, optimize settings, and find bottlenecks. Free, private, no signup required.">
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-6">
    <div>
      <h1 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-dark-ink tracking-tight">About RunFps</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-mid-gray dark:text-dark-mid-gray mt-1">Know your FPS. Tweak your settings. Play better.</p>
    </div>

    <p class="text-sm text-mid-gray dark:text-dark-mid-gray leading-relaxed">Pick your hardware and a game, and we'll show you the FPS — plus what to tweak if you want more. Everything runs in your browser. Nothing leaves your machine.</p>

    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink dark:text-dark-ink mb-2">What you can do:</p>
      <ul class="text-sm text-mid-gray dark:text-dark-mid-gray space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside">
        <li>Estimate FPS for any GPU, CPU, and game combo</li>
        <li>Get optimized settings for your target framerate</li>
        <li>Find out if your CPU or GPU is the bottleneck</li>
        <li>Compare hardware side by side</li>
        <li>Browse GPU and CPU benchmarks</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <p class="text-sm text-mid-gray dark:text-dark-mid-gray leading-relaxed">Free. No signup. No tracking.</p>

    <p class="text-sm text-mid-gray dark:text-dark-mid-gray leading-relaxed">Questions or feedback? Email <a href="mailto:hello@runfps.com" class="text-ink dark:text-dark-ink underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-ember transition-colors duration-120">hello@runfps.com</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
